#. +> trunk
#: printing/rbs_appearance.ui:73
msgid "If you often add contacts to your printout manually before entering them into the KDE address book, you should set this option to a value greater than 0: it determines how many empty address fields are to be printed; if this many do not fit onto the page, another page with only empty fields will be printed."
